Name            stand~
Cname           站起來~
Function        do_stand~
Position        POS_SLEEPING
Level           0
Log             LOG_NORMAL
Exact           NO
Argument        NO
Wizlog          NO
Jail            YES
CanLock         YES
Dead            YES
Order           NO
Lost            YES
Lock            NO
